#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:1
msgid "房间和地图"
msgstr "Rooms and Maps"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:3
msgid "作者"
msgstr "Author"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:4
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;建建"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Jianjian"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:7
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:9
msgid "发⽣战⽃的场景"
msgstr "Battle Scenes"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:11
msgid "测试⽤例"
msgstr "Test Cases"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:13
msgid "正确根据关卡ID，⽣成地图。"
msgstr "Correctly generate the map based on the level ID."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:14
msgid "房间占领状态正确初始化，读配置⽂件。"
msgstr "Room occupation status is correctly initialized by reading the configuration file."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:15
msgid "房间占领状态正确变化，需要⻆⾊、敌⼈都做了才能测试。"
msgstr "Room occupation status changes correctly; testing requires both character and enemy implementations."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:17
msgid "属性"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:19
msgid "房间ID，⽣成时读取表格数据"
msgstr "Room ID, reads table data when generated"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:20
msgid "⻓度"
msgstr "Length"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:21
#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:34
msgid "房间类型"
msgstr "Room Type"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:22
msgid "枚举变量，有多个值：普通、玩家出⽣点、胜利⽬标（占领后获胜）等"
msgstr "Enum variable with multiple values: Normal, Player Spawn Point, Victory Objective (win upon occupation), etc."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:23
msgid "拥有者"
msgstr "Owner"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:24
msgid "枚举变量，⼀共有3个值：玩家占领、敌军占领、中⽴"
msgstr "Enum variable with 3 values: Player Occupied, Enemy Occupied, Neutral"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:25
msgid "初始状态读取配置⽂件，否则默认中⽴"
msgstr "Initial status read from configuration file; defaults to Neutral if not specified"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:27
msgid "配置"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:29
msgid "使⽤2个表来存储地图信息"
msgstr "Use 2 tables to store map information"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:31
msgid "表格1：记录房间基础信息"
msgstr "Table 1: Record Basic Room Information"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:32
msgid "关卡ID，int变量，如1001"
msgstr "Level ID, int variable, e.g. 1001"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:33
msgid "房间ID，int变量，如001"
msgstr "Room ID, int variable, e.g. 001"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:35
msgid "初始拥有者"
msgstr "Initial Owner"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:36
msgid "⻓度（需要确定距离的单位）   Length: 1000"
msgstr "Length (distance unit needs to be determined)   Length: 1000"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:38
msgid "占领后获得的奖励，填写效果ID   Occupy: 001"
msgstr "Reward obtained after occupation, fill in effect ID   Occupy: 001"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:40
msgid "表格2：记录房间之间的连接关系"
msgstr "Table 2: Record Connection Relationships Between Rooms"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:41
msgid "关卡ID，如1001"
msgstr "Level ID, e.g. 1001"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:42
msgid "相互连接2个房间ID，如（001，002）"
msgstr "Two mutually connected Room IDs, e.g. (001, 002)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:44
msgid "规则"
msgstr "Rules"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:46
msgid "⽣成"
msgstr "Generation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:47
msgid "根据关卡ID读取表格数据，根据房间ID从⼩到⼤⽣成房间"
msgstr "Read table data based on Level ID, generate rooms in ascending order of Room ID"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:48
msgid "变化"
msgstr "Changes"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:49
msgid "房间可以被某⼀⽅占领"
msgstr "Rooms can be occupied by either side"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:50
msgid "当某个房间只有⼀⽅单位时开始计时，计时到达10秒后被⼀⽅占领。"
msgstr "When a room has units from only one side, a timer starts. After 10 seconds, the room is occupied by that side."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:51
msgid "计时阶段如果这⼀⽅单位消失或者另⼀⽅单位进⼊，则计时器归零。"
msgstr "During the timer phase, if the units of that side disappear or units of the other side enter, the timer resets to zero."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/ideas/room-map.md:52
msgid "主动占领后，触发房间配置的占领效果"
msgstr "Upon active occupation, the room's configured occupation effect is triggered"
